# RouteGuard — LLM provider credentials.
#
# Two ways to run the 4-model experiment.
#
# === OPTION A (recommended): OpenRouter ===
# Single key, OpenAI-API-compatible. Works with the existing
# OpenAICompatibleClient for GPT-4o-mini, Haiku, Qwen, Llama, etc.
# Get a key at https://openrouter.ai/keys
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
OPENROUTER_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1

# === OPTION B: direct provider keys ===
# Use these if you prefer not to route through OpenRouter.
# Haiku via direct Anthropic requires a small additional client; ask if you
# need it. The other three work with the existing OpenAI-compatible client
# (Together / Fireworks / Groq all expose Llama + Qwen via that interface).
OPENAI_API_KEY=
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
TOGETHER_API_KEY=
GROQ_API_KEY=
